<figure class="late-payment-diagram" aria-labelledby="late-payment-caption">
  <svg
    class="late-payment-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 580"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="late-payment-title late-payment-desc"
  >
    <title id="late-payment-title">同一張訂單，兩種本地交易順序</title>
    <desc id="late-payment-desc"
      >取消先提交時，訂單維持取消，晚到付款被記錄並建立退款待辦。付款先提交時，訂單維持已付款，未付款取消被拒絕。兩種順序都保留真實收款，不以通知到達順序推測遠端收款時間。</desc
    >
    <defs
      ><marker
        id="late-payment-arrow"
        markerWidth="8"
        markerHeight="8"
        refX="7"
        refY="4"
        orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 L8 4 L0 8 Z"></path></marker
      ></defs
    >
    <text x="40" y="42" class="late-payment-diagram__title"
      >同一張訂單，先取得鎖並提交的決定生效</text
    >
    <text x="40" y="73" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >這是本店履約政策；通知先後不等於金流收款先後。</text
    >
    <rect
      x="30"
      y="105"
      width="900"
      height="175"
      rx="16"
      class="late-payment-diagram__row"></rect>
    <text x="54" y="140" class="late-payment-diagram__title">取消先提交</text>
    <rect
      x="54"
      y="166"
      width="244"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="72" y="194" class="late-payment-diagram__label">A：cancelled</text
    ><text x="72" y="222" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >預留已釋放，可賣給 B</text
    >
    <path d="M308 207 H342" class="late-payment-diagram__arrow"></path>
    <rect
      x="354"
      y="166"
      width="220"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="372" y="194" class="late-payment-diagram__label">晚到付款成功</text
    ><text x="372" y="222" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >保存同一筆收款</text
    >
    <path d="M584 207 H618" class="late-payment-diagram__arrow"></path>
    <rect
      x="630"
      y="166"
      width="276"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="648" y="194" class="late-payment-diagram__label"
      >A 不復活，建立退款待辦</text
    ><text x="648" y="222" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >收款與待辦共同提交</text
    >
    <rect
      x="30"
      y="305"
      width="900"
      height="175"
      rx="16"
      class="late-payment-diagram__row"></rect>
    <text x="54" y="340" class="late-payment-diagram__title"
      >付款處理先提交</text
    >
    <rect
      x="54"
      y="366"
      width="244"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="72" y="394" class="late-payment-diagram__label">A：paid</text><text
      x="72"
      y="422"
      class="late-payment-diagram__detail">收款已記錄，預留仍 held</text
    >
    <path d="M308 407 H342" class="late-payment-diagram__arrow"></path>
    <rect
      x="354"
      y="366"
      width="220"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="372" y="394" class="late-payment-diagram__label"
      >未付款取消抵達</text
    ><text x="372" y="422" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >鎖定後重讀 A 的狀態</text
    >
    <path d="M584 407 H618" class="late-payment-diagram__arrow"></path>
    <rect
      x="630"
      y="366"
      width="276"
      height="82"
      rx="10"
      class="late-payment-diagram__card"></rect>
    <text x="648" y="394" class="late-payment-diagram__label"
      >拒絕這條取消路徑</text
    ><text x="648" y="422" class="late-payment-diagram__detail"
      >已付款取消須另訂規則</text
    >
    <text x="40" y="532" class="late-payment-diagram__label"
      >兩條路都記下收款；只有第一條產生本篇的退款責任。</text
    >
  </svg>
  <div class="late-payment-diagram__mobile">
    <section>
      <h3>取消先提交</h3><ol>
        <li>A 已取消，預留已釋放，可以賣給 B。</li><li>
          付款通知晚到，保存收款。
        </li><li>A 維持取消；收款與唯一退款待辦共同提交。</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>付款處理先提交</h3><ol>
        <li>A 已付款，收款已記錄，預留仍保留。</li><li>
          未付款取消取得鎖後重讀 A。
        </li><li>拒絕這條取消路徑；已付款取消須另訂規則。</li>
      </ol>
    </section>
    <p>這是本店履約政策。通知先後不代表金流實際收款的先後。</p>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="late-payment-caption">
    付款事實保存在兩條路徑中，取消決定則不被晚到通知推翻。
  </figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
